<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Corp H1 net down to 4.69 bln won.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Corp H1 net down to 4.69 bln won.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		 413     vs    901</p>
<p>    Net			   4.69  vs	7.02</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	 5.22  vs	8.30</p>
<p>    Turnover	     11,211.57  vs  9,571.63</p>
<p>NOTE - Hyundai Corp is a foreign trading unit of the Hyundai Group . The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
</text>
